{"id": "15-2224-2-25", "zh": "Camme，cammasmiṃ，cammamhi，cammani；vesme，vesmasmiṃ，vesmamhi，vesmani；ghamme，ghammasmiṃ，ghammamhi，ghammani。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-2224-26-29", "zh": "其他的词也应这样配出词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-2225-2-7", "zh": "Kammaṃ，kammāni，kammā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2225-8-13", "zh": "Kammaṃ，kammāni，kamme。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2225-14-23", "zh": "Kammena，kammunā，kammanā，kammehi，kammebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2225-24-29", "zh": "Kammassa，kammuno，kammānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2225-30-39", "zh": "Kammasmā，kammamhā，kammunā，kammehi，kammebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2225-40-45", "zh": "Kammassa，kammuno，kammānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2225-46-55", "zh": "Kamme，kammasmiṃ，kammamhi，kammani，kammesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2225-56-64", "zh": "Bho kamma，bhavanto kammāni，bhavanto kammā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2226-2-34", "zh": "至于 thāma 一词，在第三格单数等位置上，应配作“thāmena，thāmunā，thāmassa，thāmuno”，以及“thāmā，thāmasmā，thāmamhā，thāmunā”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-2227-2-21", "zh": "至于带 vantu、mantu、imantu 词缀而以鼻音（niggahīta）结尾的词，则依“guṇavaṃ cittaṃ（具德的心）、rucimaṃ pupphaṃ（有光彩的花）、pāpimaṃ kulaṃ（邪恶的家族）”等用例，配出如下词形：", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-2228-2-10", "zh": "Guṇavaṃ，guṇavantāni，guṇavantā，guṇavanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2228-11-17", "zh": "Guṇavantaṃ，guṇavantāni，guṇavante，guṇavanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-2228-18-25", "zh": "Guṇavatā，guṇavantena，guṇavantehi，guṇavantebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2228-26-33", "zh": "Guṇavato，guṇavantassa，guṇavataṃ，guṇavantānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2228-34-45", "zh": "Guṇavatā，guṇavantā，guṇavantasmā，guṇavantamhā，guṇavantehi，guṇavantebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2228-46-53", "zh": "Guṇavato，guṇavantassa，guṇavataṃ，guṇavantānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2228-54-63", "zh": "Guṇavati，guṇavante，guṇavantasmiṃ，guṇavantamhi，guṇavantesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2228-64-71", "zh": "Bho guṇava，bhavanto guṇavantāni，guṇavanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2229-2-27", "zh": "同样，应以“rucimaṃ，rucimantāni，rucimanti”等，以及“pāpimaṃ，pāpimantāni，pāpimanti”等配出词形。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-2229-28-41", "zh": "此外，在这里还应以“guṇavaṃ、balavaṃ、yasavaṃ、satimaṃ、gatimaṃ”等词广举用例。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-2230-2-15", "zh": "karonta 一词，依“karontaṃ cittaṃ（正在作为的心）、karontaṃ kulaṃ（正在作为的家族）”这样的用例，配出如下词形：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-2231-2-9", "zh": "Karontaṃ，karontāni，karontā，karonti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2231-10-17", "zh": "Karontaṃ，karontāni，karonte，karonti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2231-18-25", "zh": "Karotā，karontena，karontehi，karontebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2231-26-35", "zh": "Karoto，karato，karontassa，karontānaṃ，karotaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2231-36-47", "zh": "Karotā，karontā，karontasmā，karontamhā，karontehi，karontebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2231-48-57", "zh": "Karoto，karato，karontassa，karontānaṃ，karotaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2231-58-67", "zh": "Karoti，karonte，karontasmiṃ，karontamhi，karontesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2231-68-79", "zh": "Bho karonta，bhavanto karontāni，karontā，karonti——应这样配出词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-2232-2-15", "zh": "至于 gacchanta 一词，则依“gacchantaṃ cittaṃ（正在行进的心）、gacchantaṃ kulaṃ（正在行进的家族）”这样的用例，配出如下词形：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-2233-2-7", "zh": "Gacchantaṃ，gacchantāni，gacchantā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2233-8-13", "zh": "Gacchantaṃ，gacchantāni，gacchante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2233-14-21", "zh": "Gacchatā，gacchantena，gacchantehi，gacchantebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2233-22-29", "zh": "Gacchato，gacchantassa，gacchantānaṃ，gacchataṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2233-30-42", "zh": "Gacchatā，gacchantā，gacchantasmā，gacchantamhā，gacchantehi，gacchantebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2233-43-50", "zh": "Gacchato，gacchantassa，gacchantānaṃ，gacchataṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2233-51-60", "zh": "Gacchati，gacchante，gacchantasmiṃ，gacchantamhi，gacchantesu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2233-61-72", "zh": "Bho gacchaṃ，bho gacchantā，bhavanto gacchantāni，gacchantā——应这样配出词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-2234-2-14", "zh": "同样，在“carantaṃ、dadantaṃ、tiṭṭhantaṃ、cintayantaṃ”等词上，也应配出名词变格表（nāmikapadamālā）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-2235-2-35", "zh": "至于 mahanta 一词则有些差别。因为从“bārāṇasirajjaṃ nāma mahā（所谓波罗奈王国是大的）”这一以“mahā”作中性词的用例来看，“mahantaṃ，mahā，mahantāni，mahantā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-2235-36-41", "zh": "Mahantaṃ，mahantāni，mahante。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-2235-42-48", "zh": "Mahatā”——应知是这样的次第。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-2235-49-53", "zh": "这些词形全都与 citta 一词的变化不同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-2236-2-6", "zh": "以上是以鼻音结尾的中性词原形的名词变格表分析，并附有抉择。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-2237-2-4", "zh": "原形以 a 类元音或 u 结尾、而以鼻音收尾的", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "15-2238-2-4", "zh": "中性词讲完了。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-2239-2-13", "zh": "现在，我们以前代诸师的观点为先导，讲述 atthavibhāvi 这个词的名词变格表——它带有“惯于（做某事）”的含义，词尾元音已被缩短：", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "15-2240-2-7", "zh": "Aṭṭhi，aṭṭhī，aṭṭhīni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2240-8-13", "zh": "Aṭṭhiṃ，aṭṭhī，aṭṭhīni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2240-14-19", "zh": "Aṭṭhinā，aṭṭhīhi，aṭṭhībhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2240-20-25", "zh": "Aṭṭhissa，aṭṭhino，aṭṭhīnaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2240-26-31", "zh": "Aṭṭhinā，aṭṭhīhi，aṭṭhībhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2240-32-37", "zh": "Aṭṭhissa，aṭṭhino，aṭṭhīnaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2240-38-43", "zh": "Aṭṭhismiṃ，aṭṭhimhi，aṭṭhīsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2240-44-52", "zh": "Bho aṭṭhi，bhavanto aṭṭhī，bhavanto aṭṭhīni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2240-53-55", "zh": "这是阎摩迦大长老（Yamakamahāthera）的观点。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-2241-2-20", "zh": "虽然这里在从格的位置上没有列出“aṭṭhismā，aṭṭhimhā”这些词形，但由于在各处都能见到与之相似的用例，也应当采用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-2241-21-39", "zh": "正如 aṭṭhi 一词那样，“satthi、dadhi、vāri、akkhi、acchi”等词也有同样的词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-2242-2-8", "zh": "Atthavibhāvi，atthavibhāvī，atthavibhāvīni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2242-9-14", "zh": "Atthavibhāviṃ，atthavibhāvī，atthavibhāvīni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2242-15-20", "zh": "Atthavibhāvinā，atthavibhāvīhi，atthavibhāvībhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2242-21-26", "zh": "Atthavibhāvissa，atthavibhāvino，atthavibhāvīnaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2242-27-35", "zh": "Atthavibhāvinā，atthavibhāvismā，atthavibhāvimhā，atthavibhāvīhi，atthavibhāvībhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "15-2242-36-41", "zh": "Atthavibhāvissa，atthavibhāvino，atthavibhāvīnaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2242-42-47", "zh": "Atthavibhāvismiṃ，atthavibhāvimhi，atthavibhāvīsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2242-48-56", "zh": "Bho atthavibhāvi，bhavanto atthavibhāvī，bhavanto atthavibhāvīni。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "15-2243-2-13", "zh": "同样，“dhammavibhāvi、cittānuparivatti、sukhakāri”等词也是这样变化。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "15-2243-14-26", "zh": "其中，aṭṭhi、satthi 等是主要名词（padhānaliṅga），因为它们不依赖别的词；atthavibhāvi、dhammavibhāvi 等是从属名词（appadhānaliṅga），因为它们依赖别的词。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-2244-2-7", "zh": "以上是以 i 结尾的中性词原形的名词变格表分析，并附有抉择。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "15-2245-2-7", "zh": "原形以 i 类元音结尾的 i 尾中性词讲完了。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "15-2246-2-12", "zh": "现在，我们以前代诸师的观点为先导，讲述 gotrabhu 这个词尾元音已被缩短的词的名词变格表：", "confidence": 70}
